{"id":"comportamiento","lemma":"comportamiento","pos":"noun","rank":1606,"glosses":["behavior"],"ipa":"/kompoɾtaˈmjento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"comportamientos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-comportamiento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tu comportamiento fue vergonzoso.","en":"Your behavior was shameful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516358"},{"text":"Apenas soporto su comportamiento.","en":"I can barely stand his behavior.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705728"},{"text":"Su comportamiento es admirable.","en":"His behavior is worthy of praise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/833005"},{"text":"No me gusta tu comportamiento.","en":"I don't like your behavior.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587317"},{"text":"Estaba avergonzado de mi comportamiento.","en":"I was ashamed of my behavior.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703734"}]}